### Get tickers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bybit/tickers

### Get candles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bybit/candles?symbol=BTCUSDT&interval=1

### Authenticate with x-api-key (replace with your key)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/token
x-api-key: your-client-api-key

### Get screener results (multi-timeframe analysis) - filtered (default)
GET http://localhost:3000/screener
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get screener results (multi-timeframe analysis) - all symbols
GET http://localhost:3000/screener?filterValid=false
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get market cap data for specific symbols (optimized with caching)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/market-cap?symbols=BTC,ETH,ADA
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get top market caps (default 100)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/market-cap/top
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get top market caps with custom limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/market-cap/top?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get all market cap data (top 100)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/market-cap
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get cache statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/market-cap/cache/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Force refresh market cap cache
POST http://localhost:3000/api/market-cap/cache/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}